<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Pet</para>
  <para style="toc1">eljwab eθθani n buTrus</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Ptr</para>
  <para style="toc3">2PE</para>
  <para style="mt">eljwab eθθani n buTrus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s">etteHaye tiγlewlin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />seg semεan buTrus, elεebδ n yesuwε elmesiyH d umerseles y elli iwiyen seg errebbenne d elli imenεane yesuwε elmesiyH s eSlaH eliman δemeqqar m elimenenne. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />fellawem eslam δemeqqar d enneεmeθ f wessenewwem erreb d seyyedne yesuwε.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">eddeεweθ n erreb d w exθeres</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />tuceyane elquδerθ n erreb θemeqqarθ elli eθnesθHeq elkul bac enedder s elteqwe max i xeniεerref s elmesiyH elli yiwyane y elmejδes d elfeDles, <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />yuceyane essis erreb elberxeθes θimeqqarin d luεeδes elli yuεδane essisneθ, bac e θebeεδem f elfsaδ n elcehweθ elli g eddunyeθe usinc eθeδewlem δicriyxen g eTTebε n erreb. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />f elxaĎer n wah egeθ ejjehδewwem bac e θernim elfeDiyleθ y elimenewwem w elmeεrfeθ y elfeDiltewwem, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />w eθθiyqeθ y elmeεrefθewwem, w eSSebr y elθiqθewwem w elteqwe yeSSebrewwem, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />w exse n ewmeθen y elteqwewwem, w exse y elkul. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />w iδekan eθwefferneθ δiywem elfDeyele belgde, exennerneθ meθemriyn exθer f elmeεrfeθ n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />w elli eθenqezneθ elfDeyele, eyeδwel ules δileεmi, yettu elli erreb yerri δ eTTaher seg leδnuwb iqδiymen. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />heδake εlac, ey ewmaθen, yelzemkum eθkunem δ ijeddiyyen g edderewwem f deεweθ n erreb δ wexθeris y xenyum. w iδekan θegiym weδin eltweTTamec xlaS. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />iδekan tegem sahen exenimir elbab n waδef y elmelx n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH elli eyeqqim dime. <verse eid="2PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />heδake εlac δ exennesfekre dime g elHweyeje, Hette iδekankum tesnemtent w ettegem disneθ s elHeq elli θewiyemt. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />w meδemni eddere yelzemni exennesfekre essisneθ dime bac eθerrem elbelewwem. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />w neč essene elli δ efarqe eddunyeθe εle qriyb, emmax i yesxen seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />w δ age elmejhuδiyw bac e θesfekrem elHweyeje θiyh diyme beεεeδ emreqiw.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">echaδeθ nimersal dedwi nlenbye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />enneθbiεc θixurrafin mleffeqneθ max i xenxebber f seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH d weseδes s elquδreθ, εlexaTer s θiTTawinenne nezre geddac nette δ emeqqer. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />w nette yiwi seg erreb elmejδ d elquδreθ max i sedyuwse eSSuwθ seg elmejδ n erreb yeqqar: "wah eyendeγ memmi emeHbuwb elli essis erDiγ egget.". <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />nesle nečin eSSuwθe yuseδ seg esme, w enkan iyδes g eddehreθ timqeddesθ. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />w εlexaTer edwi n lenbye elli γenne δ SaHiyH, w xenyum eθegem elHajeθ tebhe max esθenzim ekeyenni δ elgaz yetDewwe g elblaseθ etsellesθ, elmeyali as θeqqes θefuθ g ulewnewwem. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />w esneθ qebl kul ciy elli Hette Hed welyetged eyfesser seg γers Hette ennubuwweθ g elxθabaθ imqedsen, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />εlexaTer eHebbe Hette ennubuwweθ θuseδ s elquδreθ n bnaδem, yemenni erruwH n elquδs θedje lebHaD n leεbaδ eδuθlayen s edwi seg erreb.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">imuεelmen ikeδδeben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />w emmax i yeffeγ qebel g ecceεb n Yisryil lenbye δ ikeδδaben, zade δefγen δiywem imuεelmen δ ikeδδaben δ esufγen elmδaheb n elhlax usinc enekren erreb elli yefδeθen, usinc eddaγen y imenensen elhlax fiyseε. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />w δ eθebεen egget δ leεbaδ elfseδensen w δekuwnen δ esbeb n esubbi n elHeq. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />w nihnin s eTmeεensen δezeyfen edwi erbeHen essiywem. yemenni eHkem fellasen seg qebl yetmenkisc w ehlexensen esetγemmeDc TiT. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />w erreb w elyesxifc f elmleyxaθ elli γleĎen, yemenni ylewweHθen g tesellesθ n jhennem w nihnin δ imketfen δiyn el was n elHsab, <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />w elyesxifc f elεalem eqδim, yemenni yuγeδ eTTuwfan y imuHacen, kan θmenye δ leεbaδ imenneεθen menbinhum nuwH elli ynabe y elxiyr. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />yeqDe erreb f eθmuwre n seduwm d eεmuwre yxerrebθent yHewweltent y iγeδ δ edders y elli δedyes beεεeδ ennesnes seg imuHacen, <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />yemenni imenneε luwT ebbehhay elli yeθgessec f ebriδ n elfsaδ elli eθbεenti elfujjar, <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />w eryaze ebehhay ikan yeεmer jerasen w ysel s elfseδensen w izer δiys s θiTTewines as beεεeδ as, usinc eθiγeD elHal. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />w erreb yessen eymenneε ibehhayen seg elmeHentensen yedj imuHacen y was n elHsab, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />bexSuwSi elli θebεen g echawi n eTbiεθensen timenzas w ettesθhanen s elquwweθ n erreb. maqel elHucemtensen! ettekkiδenc esubben iyh n elmejδ, <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />w Hette elmlayxe elli nihnin γersen elquδreθ exθrensen, elγeldenc s elkelmeθ θuHec y erreb. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />emme nihnin m elhwayec elli elγersenc elεaqel, etsubben elli eθesinenc w θemmaruneθ y weSθaδi δ enγe. w lazim ehelxen m nihenti. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />δeqasen eδδenb f elli egint. etεilaken eγĎes g elleδδaθ jHar δ elHajeθ ettemeqqerθ. yemenni nihnin δ elwsex δ elεib. ettesθeHlen g enzaseθ w exennexδεen, usinc exencarxen g elwlayemensen. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />γersen tiTTawin εebbaneθ s ezna, elčebbeεc seg eδnuwb xlaS, xedεen g lenfuws uDεiyfen, ulewnensen mesθensin s eTmeε. w nihnin δ idrari n elleεneθ. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />djyin ebriδ ebehhay raHen εlexaTer eTfen ebriδ n belεam n beεuwr elli yexs eyawi lefluws f eδδembes, <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />yemenni yemwebbex f elmeεSyeθe elli yegit, max e yuθley eγyul δ ebekkuc s eSSuθ n bnaδem yesbed elhbal θixerxes n enbiδin. <verse eid="2PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />imeεelmene ikδaben δ iseqqen iddisenc amen w δ esHab yθawi δiys aDu yeqwe, erreb iHeDrasen elεδab δ emeqqar. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />eqqaren g edwi δ emmeqqar δ elfareγ xedεen f elXaDren echawi n eTebiεθensen d elfsaδ g elli kanen bδan δ beεδen f elfusseδ. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />w εδen δisen s eHurriyyeθ emme nihnin biδhum δ ixδiymen n elfsaδ, εlexaTer elli eyeγleb bnaδem eθyesθeεbeδ. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />w elli emneεen seg elfsaδ n eddunyeθ, beεεeδ isnen seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH, iδakan εewδen HSalen δiys, ellexerθensen δeθkuwn exyeb n elbδunsen. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />lukan ellessinenc ebriδ ebehhay xiyr n elli eθesnen, w elbeεεeδ ebeεδen felles etwen elwSayeθ timqeddesθ elli iwyenteθ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />w sahen eyeSδeq δiysen elmθel elli yeqqar, "yerjeε eyδi f iθqeyyenes w θexenzirθ elli θessireδ θerjeε fiyseε etteθmerreγ g elwsex".<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">elweεδ s waseδ n elmeSiyH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />wah δ eljwab eθθani exenttarye, ey ewmaθen, bac exencejeεe eθfekrem belgde s esfekker y xenyum g elHajeθ tesnemtent. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />esfekreθ edwi elli yuseδ f iyles n lembiye iqeddiysen d elwSaye n errebbenne elli imenεane. elli xebbernawem imerselewwem essisen. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />w qebl kul ciy yelzem eθesnem elli δ edyes g ellexer elleyyam leεbaδ etteθfisaxen, emsuqen eccehwθensen. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />ennen: "yuεeδ s waseδ, mani yelle? midnenne emmuwθen yeqqim kul ciy em nette seg elli θebδe eddunyeθ!" <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />w nihnin θerren g imenensen ellessinenc elli erreb s elkelmeθ yexleq esmaweθ d elqaεεeθ elli erreb esufeγet seg wamen ybeyent s wamen. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />w s kelimeθ zade yeγreq elεalem eqδim g wamen yehlex, <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />emme esmaweθ d elqaεεeθ g liyyemenne θiyh, eqqiymneθ y elεefyeθ s elkelmeθ n erreb biδhe elwas n elHsab d wehlax n imuHacen. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />w θelle elHajeθ meyelzemkumc eθeγflem felles, ey ewmaθen, w elli as iyjen γer erreb m elf esne, w elli elf esne m was iyjen. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />werreb yetwexxerc age nelweεδes, emmax iθettehmen lebHaD, yemenni yeSber fellawem εlexaTer liγic eyehlex Hette iyjen, yemenni etaben elkul.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />yemenni as n erreb δ edyes emmax i yθaseδ essareq, emmunkesneθ esmaweθ g wesδin s eSSuθ emessaεqeθ yemmunkes kul ciy disneθ s elεafyeθ, usinc eθemHakem elqeεεeθ δ elεmayel elli δiys. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />w iδekan elHejaθe elkul δ emrekneθ, max δeθkuwnem xenyum? yelzemkum eθeTfem ebriδ n etteqwe d elqδaseθ. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />etrajem w eθzerbem g waseδ n was n erreb fiyseε? max edyes as diyn, δ elhebneθ esmaweθ, yemmunkes kul ciy disneθ s elεafyeθ. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />yemenni netraje emmax e yuwεeδ erreb, esmaweθ ettijδiyδin w elqeεεeθ ettejδit eyeεmer δiysen elHeq. <verse eid="2PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />egeθ elmejhuδewwem, ey ewmaθen, w xenyum etrajem g was diyn, bac e xenyef erreb g eslem, w eddiwemc elεib w eHebbac elluwm fellawem ezzeθes. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />w eHsbeθ eSSebr n erreb δ elfurseθ y wemneεewwem, emmax i xenyuwri yewweθne buwlus weδin, f elqδer n elHekmeθ elli yuceyest erreb. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />w elli yuriθi g eljwebes y xenyum, m elli yuθlay felles g eljwebes eddiyn f elHejaθe. w eseδneθ δiys luwmur uεerneθ yemenni entHerfen ejjuhhal d elli ennefsensen δεaf, emmax i θegen g elxθabeθ imqedsen iddiyn, y wehlax n ennefsensen.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">etHaye θigluxrin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />emme xenyum ey ewmaθen, tewiyem elwSayeθ seg γenne, emmale erreθ elbelewwem elli ellesinenc elHeq exenttewyenc y webriδ emuHac usinc eθexsrem elHajeθ tebehheyθ elli γerwem seg qebl. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />tekbarem g enneεmeθ d wessen n seyyedne yesuwε elmesiyH elli ymenεane. y nette elmejδ ture diyme. amiyn!<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>